lass=" block-bvmbflj fg-f1sorag4 display2-d3fywui display2-d1fkc23d display2-dmahq7d display2-d10bcbec start-szg9oeq none-ng7kred _2-_19s6k53 _1-_w6vuf9 baseCss-bc3l1w2" style="--text-textTransform:var(--textTransform-display2)"><strong class="RichText__BoldText-sc-a0f6aa2-0 ireNeW">BTC rallied after the Fed cut rates, but what will happen next? </strong></h3><p class="Text__TextBodyLarge-sc-f188a967-4 Section__StyledTextBodyLarge-sc-7e3c6137-0 kSsJYJ eCzJqN">Last week, the <a class=" inline-i1d5xt2g fgPrimary-f1viahif _0-_19in606 _0-_sikgx6 _0-_1dt7gbp cds-Interactable baseCss-b17wmk8f baseCss-b1nrmodp baseCss-b678mx9" style="--inter-bg:var(--color-transparent);--inter-borderColor:var(--color-transparent);--inter-hover-bg:transparent;--inter-hover-borderColor:transparent;--inter-hover-opacity:0.88;--inter-press-bg:transparent;--inter-press-borderColor:transparent;--inter-press-opacity:0.82;--inter-disable-bg:transparent;--inter-disable-borderColor:transparent" rel="noreferrer noopener" target="_blank" href="https://www.coinbase.com/price/united-stables"><span class=" inline-i1d5xt2g currentColor-c1ul679q inherit-i8cekjn inherit-i5yfwju inherit-i19jd86n inherit-i1q2zm4n start-szg9oeq none-ng7kred baseCss-bc3l1w2" style="--text-textTransform:var(--textTransform-inherit)">U</span></a>.S. Federal Reserve <a class=" inline-i1d5xt2g fgPrimary-f1viahif _0-_19in606 _0-_sikgx6 _0-_1dt7gbp cds-Interactable baseCss-b17wmk8f baseCss-b1nrmodp baseCss-b678mx9" style="--inter-bg:var(--color-transparent);--inter-borderColor:var(--color-transparent);--inter-hover-bg:transparent;--inter-hover-borderColor:transparent;--inter-hover-opacity:0.88;--inter-press-bg:transparent;--inter-press-borderColor:transparent;--inter-press-opacity:0.82;--inter-disable-bg:transparent;--inter-disable-borderColor:transparent" rel="noreferrer noopener" target="_blank" href="https://www.coinbase.com/bytes/archive/bitcoin-and-the-feds-rate-cut"><span class=" inline-i1d5xt2g currentColor-c1ul679q inherit-i8cekjn inherit-i5yfwju inherit-i19jd86n inherit-i1q2zm4n start-szg9oeq none-ng7kred baseCss-bc3l1w2" style="--text-textTransform:var(--textTransform-inherit)">cut interest rates</span></a> by half a percentage point — a move that helped boost markets of all kinds, including crypto. In the subsequent week, <a class=" inline-i1d5xt2g fgPrimary-f1viahif _0-_19in606 _0-_sikgx6 _0-_1dt7gbp cds-Interactable baseCss-b17wmk8f baseCss-b1nrmodp baseCss-b678mx9" style="--inter-bg:var(--color-transparent);--inter-borderColor:var(--color-transparent);--inter-hover-bg:transparent;--inter-hover-borderColor:transparent;--inter-hover-opacity:0.88;--inter-press-bg:transparent;--inter-press-borderColor:transparent;--inter-press-opacity:0.82;--inter-disable-bg:transparent;--inter-disable-borderColor:transparent" rel="noreferrer noopener" target="_blank" href="https://www.coinbase.com/price/bitcoin"><span class=" inline-i1d5xt2g currentColor-c1ul679q inherit-i8cekjn inherit-i5yfwju inherit-i19jd86n inherit-i1q2zm4n start-szg9oeq none-ng7kred baseCss-bc3l1w2" style="--text-textTransform:var(--textTransform-inherit)">BTC</span></a> climbed close to highs <a class=" inline-i1d5xt2g fgPrimary-f1viahif _0-_19in606 _0-_sikgx6 _0-_1dt7gbp cds-Interactable baseCss-b17wmk8f baseCss-b1nrmodp baseCss-b678mx9" style="--inter-bg:var(--color-transparent);--inter-borderColor:var(--color-transparent);--inter-hover-bg:transparent;--inter-hover-borderColor:transparent;--inter-hover-opacity:0.88;--inter-press-bg:transparent;--inter-press-borderColor:transparent;--inter-press-opacity:0.82;--inter-disable-bg:transparent;--inter-disable-borderColor:transparent" rel="noreferrer noopener" target="_blank" href="https://decrypt.co/250849/bitcoin-august-high-analysts-caution"><span class=" inline-i1d5xt2g currentColor-c1ul679q inherit-i8cekjn inherit-i5yfwju inherit-i19jd86n inherit-i1q2zm4n start-szg9oeq none-ng7kred baseCss-bc3l1w2" style="--text-textTransform:var(--textTransform-inherit)">last seen</span></a> i