</p><p class="Text__TextBodyLarge-sc-f188a967-4 Section__StyledTextBodyLarge-sc-7e3c6137-0 kSsJYJ eCzJqN">On Friday, the <a class=" inline-i1d5xt2g fgPrimary-f1viahif _0-_19in606 _0-_sikgx6 _0-_1dt7gbp cds-Interactable baseCss-b17wmk8f baseCss-b1nrmodp baseCss-b678mx9" style="--inter-bg:var(--color-transparent);--inter-borderColor:var(--color-transparent);--inter-hover-bg:transparent;--inter-hover-borderColor:transparent;--inter-hover-opacity:0.88;--inter-press-bg:transparent;--inter-press-borderColor:transparent;--inter-press-opacity:0.82;--inter-disable-bg:transparent;--inter-disable-borderColor:transparent" rel="noreferrer noopener" target="_blank" href="https://www.coinbase.com/price/united-stables"><span class=" inline-i1d5xt2g currentColor-c1ul679q inherit-i8cekjn inherit-i5yfwju inherit-i19jd86n inherit-i1q2zm4n start-szg9oeq none-ng7kred baseCss-bc3l1w2" style="--text-textTransform:var(--textTransform-inherit)">U</span></a>.S. Securities and Exchange Commission (SEC) gave the Nasdaq the greenlight to begin <a class=" inline-i1d5xt2g fgPrimary-f1viahif _0-_19in606 _0-_sikgx6 _0-_1dt7gbp cds-Interactable baseCss-b17wmk8f baseCss-b1nrmodp baseCss-b678mx9" style="--inter-bg:var(--color-transparent);--inter-borderColor:var(--color-transparent);--inter-hover-bg:transparent;--inter-hover-borderColor:transparent;--inter-hover-opacity:0.88;--inter-press-bg:transparent;--inter-press-borderColor:transparent;--inter-press-opacity:0.82;--inter-disable-bg:transparent;--inter-disable-borderColor:transparent" rel="noreferrer noopener" target="_blank" href="https://www.reuters.com/technology/sec-approves-spot-bitcoin-etf-options-2024-09-20/"><span class=" inline-i1d5xt2g currentColor-c1ul679q inherit-i8cekjn inherit-i5yfwju inherit-i19jd86n inherit-i1q2zm4n start-szg9oeq none-ng7kred baseCss-bc3l1w2" style="--text-textTransform:var(--textTransform-inherit)">listing and trading</span></a> options for BlackRock’s spot <a class=" inline-i1d5xt2g fgPrimary-f1viahif _0-_19in606 _0-_sikgx6 _0-_1dt7gbp cds-Interactable baseCss-b17wmk8f baseCss-b1nrmodp baseCss-b678mx9" style="--inter-bg:var(--color-transparent);--inter-borderColor:var(--color-transparent);--inter-hover-bg:transparent;--inter-hover-borderColor:transparent;--inter-hover-opacity:0.88;--inter-press-bg:transparent;--inter-press-borderColor:transparent;--inter-press-opacity:0.82;--inter-disable-bg:transparent;--inter-disable-borderColor:transparent" rel="noreferrer noopener" target="_blank" href="https://www.coinbase.com/price/bitcoin"><span class=" inline-i1d5xt2g currentColor-c1ul679q inherit-i8cekjn inherit-i5yfwju inherit-i19jd86n inherit-i1q2zm4n start-szg9oeq none-ng7kred baseCss-bc3l1w2" style="--text-textTransform:var(--textTransform-inherit)">BTC</span></a> ETF (IBIT). (Options are a form of derivative contract that allow traders the “option” to buy shares of a stock, ETF, or other asset at a given price on a given date.) </p><p class="Text__TextBodyLarge-sc-f188a967-4 Section__StyledTextBodyLarge-sc-7e3c6137-0 kSsJYJ eCzJqN">Analysts <a class=" inline-i1d5xt2g fgPrimary-f1viahif _0-_19in606 _0-_sikgx6 _0-_1dt7gbp cds-Interactable baseCss-b17wmk8f baseCss-b1nrmodp baseCss-b678mx9" style="--inter-bg:var(--color-transparent);--inter-borderColor:var(--color-transparent);--inter-hover-bg:transparent;--inter-hover-borderColor:transparent;--inter-hover-opacity:0.88;--inter-press-bg:transparent;--inter-press-borderColor:transparent;--inter-press-opacity:0.82;--inter-disable-bg:transparent;--inter-disable-borderColor:transparent" rel="noreferrer noopener" target="_blank" href="https://decrypt.co/250832/will-bitcoin-etf-options-send-the-asset-to-the-moon-heres-what-experts-say"><span class=" inline-i1d5xt2g currentColor-c1ul679q inherit-i8cekjn inherit-i5yfwju inherit-i19jd86n inherit-i1q2zm4n start-szg9oeq none-ng7kred baseCss-bc3l1w2" style="--text-textTransform:var(--textTransform-inherit)">are split</span></a> on the potential impact on BTC<!-- --> prices. According to Bitwise analyst Jeff Park, the move <a class=" inline-i1d5xt2g fgPrimary-f1viahif _0-_19in606 _0-_sikgx6 _0-_1dt7gbp cds-Interactable baseCss-b17wmk8f baseCss-b1nrmodp baseCss-b678mx9" style="--inter-bg:var(--color-transparent);--inter-borderColor:var(--color-transparent);--inter-hover-bg:transparent;--inter-hover-borderColor:transparent;--inter-hover-opacity:0.88;--inter-press-bg:transparent;--inter-press-borderColor:transparent;--inter-press-opacity:0.82;--inter-disable-bg:transparent;--inter-disable-borderColor:transparent" rel="noreferrer noopener" target="_blank" href="https://x.com/dgt10011/status/1837278352823972147"><span class=" inline-i1d5xt2g currentColor-c1ul679q inherit-i8cekjn inherit-i5yfwju inherit-i19jd86n inherit-i1q2zm4n start-szg9oeq none-ng7kred baseCss-bc3l1w2" style="--text-textTransform:var(--textTransform-inherit)">could allow</span></a> Wall Street traders to devise new strategies using leverage (or borrowed capital), which has the potential to drive major swings in prices. </p><p class="Text__TextBodyLarge-sc-f188a967-4 Section__StyledTextBodyLarge-sc-7e3c6137-0 kSsJYJ eCzJqN">Other pundits, including CoinShares’ James Butterfill, suggested the opposite — that options could <i>reduce</i> volatility in the longer term as traders learn to use them to manage risk. </p><div class=" flex-ff5rfy6 column-c1fk6aoh _2-_103qa78"><li><p class="Text__TextBodyLarge-sc-f188a967-4 Section__StyledTextBodyLarge-sc-7e3c6137-0 kSsJYJ eCzJqN"><strong class="RichText__BoldText-sc-a0f6aa2-0 ireNeW">Top of the Rock…</strong> A new whitepaper from BlackRock <a class=" inline-i1d5xt2g fgPrimary-f1viahif _0-_19in606 _0-_sikgx6 _0-_1dt7gbp cds-Interactable baseCss-b17wmk8f baseCss-b1nrmodp baseCss-b678mx9" style="--inter-bg:var(--color-transparent);--inter-borderColor:var(--color-transparent);--inter-hover-bg:transparent;--inter-hover-borderColor:transparent;--inter-hover-opacity:0.88;--inter-press-bg:transparent;--inter-press-borderColor:transparent;--inter-press-opacity:0.82;--inter-disable-bg:transparent;--inter-disable-borderColor:transparent" rel="noreferrer noopener" target="_blank" href="https://www.theblock.co/post/317126/blackrocks-new-bitcoin-paper-outlines-the-cryptocurrencys-qualities-as-unique-hedge-against-global-risks"><span class=" inline-i1d5xt2g currentColor-c1ul679q inherit-i8cekjn inherit-i5yfwju inherit-i19jd86n inherit-i1q2zm4n start-szg9oeq none-ng7kred baseCss-bc3l1w2" style="--text-textTransform:var(--textTransform-inherit)">delves into</span></a> BTC<!-- -->’s increasingly mainstream role on Wall Street and beyond. The report notes that BTC<!-- --> can be seen as a “unique diversifier” for portfolios, that it has frequently outperformed other major asset classes in the last decade (though it has also seen years of significant underperformance), and that for some it represents a &quot;flight to safety&quot; in uncertain geopolitical environments. </p></li></div><p class="Text__TextBodyLarge-sc-f188a967-4 Section__StyledTextBodyLarge-sc-7e3c6137-0 kSsJYJ eCzJqN"><a class=" inline-i1d5xt2g fgPrimary-f1viahif _0-_19in606 _0-_sikgx6 _0-_1dt7gbp cds-Interactable baseCss-b17wmk8f baseCss-b1nrmodp baseCss-b678mx9" style="--inter-bg:var(--color-transparent);--inter-borderColor:var(--color-transparent);--inter-hover-bg:transparent;--inter-hover-borderColor:transparent;--inter-hover-opacity:0.88;--inter-press-bg:transparent;--inter-press-borderColor:transparent;--inter-press-opacity:0.82;--inter-disable-bg:transparent;--inter-disable-borderColor:transparent" rel="noreferrer noopener" target="_blank" href="https://www.coinbase.com/price/ethereum"><span class=" inline-i1d5xt2g currentColor-c1ul679q inherit-i8cekjn inherit-i5yfwju inherit-i19jd86n inherit-i1q2zm4n start-szg9oeq none-ng7kred baseCss-bc3l1w2" style="--text-textTransform:var(--textTransform-inherit)"><strong class="RichText__BoldText-sc-a0f6aa2-0 ireNeW">ETH</strong></span></a><strong class="RichText__BoldText-sc-a0f6aa2-0 ireNeW"> rebounds following Fed rate cut </strong></p><p class="Text__TextBodyLarge-sc-f188a967-4 Section__StyledTextBodyLarge-sc-7e3c6137-0 kSsJYJ eCzJqN">In last week’s edition of Bytes, we noted that <a class=" inline-i1d5xt2g fgPrimary-f1viahif _0-_19in606 _0-_sikgx6 _0-_1dt7gbp cds-Interactable baseCss-b17wmk8f baseCss-b1nrmodp baseCss-b678mx9" style="--inter-bg:var(--color-transparent);--inter-borderColor:var(--color-transparent);--inter-hover-bg:transparent;--inter-hover-borderColor:transparent;--inter-hover-opacity:0.88;--inter-press-bg:transparent;--inter-press-borderColor:transparent;--inter-press-opacity:0.82;--inter-disable-bg:transparent;--inter-disable-borderColor:transparent" rel="noreferrer noopener" target="_blank" href="https://www.coinbase.com/price/ethereum"><span class=" inline-i1d5xt2g currentColor-c1ul679q inherit-i8cekjn inherit-i5yfwju inherit-i19jd86n inherit-i1q2zm4n start-szg9oeq none-ng7kred baseCss-bc3l1w2" style="--text-textTransform:var(--textTransform-inherit)">ETH</span></a> has <a class=" inline-i1d5xt2g fgPrimary-f1viahif _0-_19in606 _0-_sikgx6 _0-_1dt7gbp cds-Interactable baseCss-b17wmk8f baseCss-b1nrmodp baseCss-b678mx9" style="--inter-bg:var(--color-transparent);--inter-borderColor:var(--color-transparent);--inter-hover-bg:transparent;--inter-hover-borderColor:transparent;--inter-hover-opacity:0.88;--inter-press-bg:transparent;--inter-press-borderColor:transparent;--inter-press-opacity:0.82;--inter-disable-bg:transparent;--inter-disable-borderColor:transparent" rel="noreferrer noopener" target="_blank" href="https://www.coinbase.com/bytes/archive/bitcoin-and-the-feds-rate-cut"><span class=" inline-i1d5xt2g currentColor-c1ul679q inherit-i8cekjn inherit-i5yfwju inherit-i19jd86n inherit-i1q2zm4n start-szg9oeq none-ng7kred baseCss-bc3l1w2" style="--text-textTransform:var(--textTransform-inherit)">been struggling</span></a> compared to BTC<!-- --> and other major tokens for months. But in the days since the Fed’s rate cut last week, that dynamic has completely flipped.  </p><p class="Text__TextBodyLarge-sc-f188a967-4 Section__StyledTextBodyLarge-sc-7e3c6137-0 kSsJYJ eCzJqN"><a class=" inline-i1d5xt2g fgPrimary-f1viahif _0-_19in606 _0-_sikgx6 _0-_1dt7gbp cds-Interactable baseCss-b17wmk8f baseCss-b1nrmodp baseCss-b678mx9" style="--inter-bg:var(--color-transparent);--inter-borderColor:var(--color-transparent);--inter-hover-bg:transparent;--inter-hover-borderColor:transparent;--inter-hover-opacity:0.88;--inter-press-bg:transparent;--inter-press-borderColor:transparent;--inter-press-opacity:0.82;--inter-disable-bg:transparent;--inter-disable-borderColor:transparent" rel="noreferrer noopener" target="_blank" href="https://www.coinbase.com/price/ethereum"><span class=" inline-i1d5xt2g currentColor-c1ul679q inherit-i8cekjn inherit-i5yfwju inherit-i19jd86n inherit-i1q2zm4n start-szg9oeq none-ng7kred baseCss-bc3l1w2" style="--text-textTransform:var(--textTransform-inherit)">ETH</span></a> <a class=" inline-i1d5xt2g fgPrimary-f1viahif _0-_19in606 _0-_sikgx6 _0-_1dt7gbp cds-Interactable baseCss-b17wmk8f baseCss-b1nrmodp baseCss-b678mx9" style="--inter-bg:var(--color-transparent);--inter-borderColor:var(--color-transparent);--inter-hover-bg:transparent;--inter-hover-borderColor:transparent;--inter-hover-opacity:0.88;--inter-press-bg:transparent;--inter-press-borderColor:transparent;--inter-press-opacity:0.82;--inter-disable-bg:transparent;--inter-disable-borderColor:transparent" rel="noreferrer noopener" target="_blank" href="https://cointelegraph.com/news/ethereum-gains-15-in-a-week-is-a-recovery-to-3-k-back-in-sight"><span class=" inline-i1d5xt2g currentColor-c1ul679q inherit-i8cekjn inherit-i5yfwju inherit-i19jd86n inherit-i1q2zm4n start-szg9oeq none-ng7kred baseCss-bc3l1w2" style="--text-textTransform:var(--textTransform-inherit)">gained more than 18%</span></a> in the week ending Monday, compared to around 7.5% for BTC<!-- -->. The Ethereum<!-- --> blockchain also saw major gains in trade volume, the number of wallets using dapps, and the total value locked on the network. </p><div class=" flex-ff5rfy6 column-c1fk6aoh _2-_103qa78"><li><p class="Text__TextBodyLarge-sc-f188a967-4 Section__StyledTextBodyLarge-sc-7e3c6137-0 kSsJYJ eCzJqN"><strong class="RichText__BoldText-sc-a0f6aa2-0 ireNeW">ETF blues… </strong>Despite the rally, spot ETH<!-- --> ETFs saw their <a class=" inline-i1d5xt2g fgPrimary-f1viahif _0-_19in606 _0-_sikgx6 _0-_1dt7gbp cds-Interactable baseCss-b17wmk8f baseCss-b1nrmodp baseCss-b678mx9" style="--inter-bg:var(--color-transparent);--inter-borderColor:var(--color-transparent);--inter-hover-bg:transparent;--inter-hover-borderColor:transparent;--inter-hover-opacity:0.88;--inter-press-bg:transparent;--inter-press-borderColor:transparent;--inter-press-opacity:0.82;--inter-disable-bg:transparent;--inter-disable-borderColor:transparent" rel="noreferrer noopener" target="_blank" href="https://www.coindesk.com/markets/2024/09/24/ether-etfs-record-biggest-outflows-since-july-in-sign-of-low-institutional-appeal/"><span class=" inline-i1d5xt2g currentColor-c1ul679q inherit-i8cekjn inherit-i5yfwju inherit-i19jd86n inherit-i1q2zm4n start-szg9oeq none-ng7kred baseCss-bc3l1w2" style="--text-textTransform:var(--textTransform-inherit)">worst day of outflows</span></a> since July on Monday. It’s important to note, however, that virtually all of the outflows came from GrayScale’s massive ETHE product, which has higher fees than the competition. Bitwise’s ETHW saw inflows of around $1.3 million. </p></li></div><p class="Text__TextBodyLarge-sc-f188a967-4 Section__StyledTextBodyLarge-sc-7e3c6137-0 kSsJYJ eCzJqN"><strong class="RichText__BoldText-sc-a0f6aa2-0 ireNeW">Stocks and crypto are more correlated than (pretty much) ever </strong></p><p class="Text__TextBodyLarge-sc-f188a967-4 Section__StyledTextBodyLarge-sc-7e3c6137-0 kSsJYJ eCzJqN">In the wake of last week’s rate cut from the Fed, crypto and stock markets shared a virtually identical reaction. As Bloomberg put it, the “40-day correlation coefficient for a gauge of the largest 100 digital assets and the S&amp;P 500 Index is at … a level exceeded only in the second quarter of 2022.”</p><p class="Text__TextBodyLarge-sc-f188a967-4 Section__StyledTextBodyLarge-sc-7e3c6137-0 kSsJYJ eCzJqN">To many analysts, this <a class=" inline-i1d5xt2g fgPrimary-f1viahif _0-_19in606 _0-_sikgx6 _0-_1dt7gbp cds-Interactable baseCss-b17wmk8f baseCss-b1nrmodp baseCss-b678mx9" style="--inter-bg:var(--color-transparent);--inter-borderColor:var(--color-transparent);--inter-hover-bg:transparent;--inter-hover-borderColor:transparent;--inter-hover-opacity:0.88;--inter-press-bg:transparent;--inter-press-borderColor:transparent;--inter-press-opacity:0.82;--inter-disable-bg:transparent;--inter-disable-borderColor:transparent" rel="noreferrer noopener" target="_blank" href="https://finance.yahoo.com/news/crypto-correlation-us-stocks-nears-050116389.html"><span class=" inline-i1d5xt2g currentColor-c1ul679q inherit-i8cekjn inherit-i5yfwju inherit-i19jd86n inherit-i1q2zm4n start-szg9oeq none-ng7kred baseCss-bc3l1w2" style="--text-textTransform:var(--textTransform-inherit)">indicates</span></a> that both markets are currently driven primarily by macroeconomic forces — meaning that all eyes are on the <a class=" inline-i1d5xt2g fgPrimary-f1viahif _0-_19in606 _0-_sikgx6 _0-_1dt7gbp cds-Interactable baseCss-b17wmk8f baseCss-b1nrmodp baseCss-b678mx9" style="--inter-bg:var(--color-transparent);--inter-borderColor:var(--color-transparent);--inter-hover-bg:transparent;--inter-hover-borderColor:transparent;--inter-hover-opacity:0.88;--inter-press-bg:transparent;--inter-press-borderColor:transparent;--inter-press-opacity:0.82;--inter-disable-bg:transparent;--inter-disable-borderColor:transparent" rel="noreferrer noopener" target="_blank" href="https://www.coinbase.com/price/united-stables"><span class=" inline-i1d5xt2g currentColor-c1ul679q inherit-i8cekjn inherit-i5yfwju inherit-i19jd86n inherit-i1q2zm4n start-szg9oeq none-ng7kred baseCss-bc3l1w2" style="--text-textTransform:var(--textTransform-inherit)">U</span></a>.S. central bank for hints about its next move. </p><div class=" flex-ff5rfy6 column-c1fk6aoh _2-_103qa78"><li><p class="Text__TextBodyLarge-sc-f188a967-4 Section__StyledTextBodyLarge-sc-7e3c6137-0 kSsJYJ eCzJqN"><strong class="RichText__BoldText-sc-a0f6aa2-0 ireNeW">Fed says… </strong>The next major clue could come later this week, when the Fed is expected to comment on a key consumer-spending metric. Longer term, most analysts <a class=" inline-i1d5xt2g fgPrimary-f1viahif _0-_19in606 _0-_sikgx6 _0-_1dt7gbp cds-Interactable baseCss-b17wmk8f baseCss-b1nrmodp baseCss-b678mx9" style="--inter-bg:var(--color-transparent);--inter-borderColor:var(--color-transparent);--inter-hover-bg:transparent;--inter-hover-borderColor:transparent;--inter-hover-opacity:0.88;--inter-press-bg:transparent;--inter-press-borderColor:transparent;--inter-press-opacity:0.82;--inter-disable-bg:transparent;--inter-disable-borderColor:transparent" rel="noreferrer noopener" target="_blank" href="https://abcnews.go.com/Business/federal-reserve-cut-interest-rates-year/story?id=113837039"><span class=" inline-i1d5xt2g currentColor-c1ul679q inherit-i8cekjn inherit-i5yfwju inherit-i19jd86n inherit-i1q2zm4n start-szg9oeq none-ng7kred baseCss-bc3l1w2" style="--text-textTransform:var(--textTransform-inherit)">expect</span></a> at least one more rate cut by the end of the year. </p></li></div><div class="ButtonCTA__ButtonContainer-sc-96b17354-0 iqekWz"><a class=" flex-ff5rfy6 fg-f1sorag4 _0-_19in606 _900-_1i1nlmz _0-_sikgx6 _4-_sm7rau _2-_1ubvwd9 _0-_1dt7gbp height-hlltmgk minWidth-mqpqo7l cds-Interactable baseCss-b17wmk8f baseCss-b1nrmodp scaledDownCss-s1o6alxd cds-Button baseCss-b99zquh" style="--height:fit-content;--minWidth:auto;--inter-bg:var(--color-bgSecondary);--inter-borderColor:var(--color-bgSecondary);--inter-hover-bg:rgb(229, 231, 234);--inter-hover-borderColor:rgb(229, 231, 234);--inter-hover-opacity:0.88;--inter-press-bg:rgb(225, 226, 229);--inter-press-borderColor:rgb(225, 226, 229);--inter-press-opacity:0.82;--inter-disable-bg:rgb(242, 244, 246);--inter-disable-borderColor:rgb(242, 244, 246)" data-block="false" data-variant="secondary" href="https://www.coinbase.com/institutional/research-insights/research/weekly-market-commentary/weekly-2024-09-20?utm_source=Iterable&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=in_i_m_w_m_m_itr_ema_0_wmc"><span class="middleNodeCss-m1avpq52"><span class=" inline-i1d5xt2g currentColor-c1ul679q headline-h15u0we0 headline-h1cz184y headline-h1axe68h headline-h1d8xh3w center-cfz97j9 none-ng7kred baseCss-bc3l1w2" style="--text-textTransform:var(--textTransform-headline)"><span class="">Read more market commentary</span></span></span></a></div><span class=" flex-ff5rfy6 height-hlltmgk flexShrink-f174hu22 flexGrow-fav9hyl" style="--height:calc(8 * var(--space-1));--flexShrink:0;--flexGrow:0" aria-hidden="true" role="presentation"></span><h2 class=" block-bvmbflj fg-f1sorag4 headline-h15u0we0 headline-h1cz184y headline-h1axe68h headline-h1d8xh3w start-szg9oeq none-ng7kred baseCss-bc3l1w2" style="--text-textTransform:var(--textTransform-headline)"><strong class="RichText__BoldText-sc-a0f6aa2-0 ireNeW">IT’S A WRAP</strong></h2><h3 class=" block-bvmbflj fg-f1sorag4 display2-d3fywui display2-d1fkc23d display2-dmahq7d display2-d10bcbec start-szg9oeq none-ng7kred _2-_19s6k53 _1-_w6vuf9 baseCss-bc3l1w2" style="--text-textTransform:var(--textTransform-display2)"><strong class="RichText__BoldText-sc-a0f6aa2-0 ireNeW">Everything you need to know about wrapped tokens and cbBTC </strong></h3><p class="Text__TextBodyLarge-sc-f188a967-4 Section__StyledTextBodyLarge-sc-7e3c6137-0 kSsJYJ eCzJqN">“Wrapped tokens” offer a solution for users wanting to make DeFi transactions and are designed to bridge the gap between blockchains. </p><p class="Text__TextBodyLarge-sc-f188a967-4 Section__StyledTextBodyLarge-sc-7e3c6137-0 kSsJYJ eCzJqN">Bitcoin has a lot of <a class=" inline-i1d5xt2g fgPrimary-f1viahif _0-_19in606 _0-_sikgx6 _0-_1dt7gbp cds-Interactable baseCss-b17wmk8f baseCss-b1nrmodp baseCss-b678mx9" style="--inter-bg:var(--color-transparent);--inter-borderColor:var(--color-transparent);--inter-hover-bg:transparent;--inter-hover-borderColor:transparent;--inter-hover-opacity:0.88;--inter-press-bg:transparent;--inter-press-borderColor:transparent;--inter-press-opacity:0.82;--inter-disable-bg:transparent;--inter-disable-borderColor:transparent" rel="noreferrer noopener" target="_blank" href="https://www.coinbase.com/en-de/learn/crypto-basics/what-is-bitcoin"><span class=" inline-i1d5xt2g currentColor-c1ul679q inherit-i8cekjn inherit-i5yfwju inherit-i19jd86n inherit-i1q2zm4n start-szg9oeq none-ng7kred baseCss-bc3l1w2" style="--text-textTransform:var(--textTransform-inherit)">advantages</span></a>: It’s fully decentralized, secure, and immutable. But it also has some limitations, which is why there is wrapped bitcoin<!-- -->. </p><p class="Text__TextBodyLarge-sc-f188a967-4 Section__StyledTextBodyLarge-sc-7e3c6137-0 kSsJYJ eCzJqN">This month, Coinbase rolled out <a class=" inline-i1d5xt2g fgPrimary-f1viahif _0-_19in606 _0-_sikgx6 _0-_1dt7gbp cds-Interactable baseCss-b17wmk8f baseCss-b1nrmodp baseCss-b678mx9" style="--inter-bg:var(--color-transparent);--inter-borderColor:var(--color-transparent);--inter-hover-bg:transparent;--inter-hover-borderColor:transparent;--inter-hover-opacity:0.88;--inter-press-bg:transparent;--inter-press-borderColor:transparent;--inter-press-opacity:0.82;--inter-disable-bg:transparent;--inter-disable-borderColor:transparent" rel="noreferrer noopener" target="_blank" href="https://www.coinbase.com/blog/coinbase-wrapped-btc-cbbtc-is-now-live"><span class=" inline-i1d5xt2g currentColor-c1ul679q inherit-i8cekjn inherit-i5yfwju inherit-i19jd86n inherit-i1q2zm4n start-szg9oeq none-ng7kred baseCss-bc3l1w2" style="--text-textTransform:var(--textTransform-inherit)">cbBTC</span></a> (Coinbase Wrapped BTC<!-- -->). In just three weeks, cbBTC — which is currently supported on Base and Ethereum<!-- --> — has become the <a class=" inline-i1d5xt2g fgPrimary-f1viahif _0-_19in606 _0-_sikgx6 _0-_1dt7gbp cds-Interactable baseCss-b17wmk8f baseCss-b1nrmodp baseCss-b678mx9" style="--inter-bg:var(--color-transparent);--inter-borderColor:var(--color-transparent);--inter-hover-bg:transparent;--inter-hover-borderColor:transparent;--inter-hover-opacity:0.88;--inter-press-bg:transparent;--inter-press-borderColor:transparent;--inter-press-opacity:0.82;--inter-disable-bg:transparent;--inter-disable-borderColor:transparent" rel="noreferrer noopener" target="_blank" href="https://milkroad.com/news/coinbase-launches-cbbtc-wrapped-bitcoin-on-solana-expanding-its-crypto-reach/"><span class=" inline-i1d5xt2g currentColor-c1ul679q inherit-i8cekjn inherit-i5yfwju inherit-i19jd86n inherit-i1q2zm4n start-szg9oeq none-ng7kred baseCss-bc3l1w2" style="--text-textTransform:var(--textTransform-inherit)">third-most popular</span></a> wrapped bitcoin<!-- --> token on the market, with <a class=" inline-i1d5xt2g fgPrimary-f1viahif _0-_19in606 _0-_sikgx6 _0-_1dt7gbp cds-Interactable baseCss-b17wmk8f baseCss-b1nrmodp baseCss-b678mx9" style="--inter-bg:var(--color-transparent);--inter-borderColor:var(--color-transparent);--inter-hover-bg:transparent;--inter-hover-borderColor:transparent;--inter-hover-opacity:0.88;--inter-press-bg:transparent;--inter-press-borderColor:transparent;--inter-press-opacity:0.82;--inter-disable-bg:transparent;--inter-disable-borderColor:transparent" rel="noreferrer noopener" target="_blank" href="https://www.coinbase.com/blog/coinbase-wrapped-btc-cbbtc-is-now-live"><span class=" inline-i1d5xt2g currentColor-c1ul679q inherit-i8cekjn inherit-i5yfwju inherit-i19jd86n inherit-i1q2zm4n start-szg9oeq none-ng7kred baseCss-bc3l1w2" style="--text-textTransform:var(--textTransform-inherit)">plans to continue expanding</span></a> to more blockchains. </p><p class="Text__TextBodyLarge-sc-f188a967-4 Section__StyledTextBodyLarge-sc-7e3c6137-0 kSsJYJ eCzJqN">But what exactly are wrapped tokens, and why do they matter? Here’s what you need to know… </p><p class="Text__TextBodyLarge-sc-f188a967-4 Section__StyledTextBodyLarge-sc-7e3c6137-0 kSsJYJ eCzJqN"><strong class="RichText__BoldText-sc-a0f6aa2-0 ireNeW">What is a wrapped token?</strong></p><p class="Text__TextBodyLarge-sc-f188a967-4 Section__StyledTextBodyLarge-sc-7e3c6137-0 kSsJYJ eCzJqN">Wrapped tokens are a type of cryptocurrency that <a class=" inline-i1d5xt2g fgPrimary-f1viahif _0-_19in606 _0-_sikgx6 _0-_1dt7gbp cds-Interactable baseCss-b17wmk8f baseCss-b1nrmodp baseCss-b678mx9" style="--inter-bg:var(--color-transparent);--inter-borderColor:var(--color-transparent);--inter-hover-bg:transparent;--inter-hover-borderColor:transparent;--inter-hover-opacity:0.88;--inter-press-bg:transparent;--inter-press-borderColor:transparent;--inter-press-opacity:0.82;--inter-disable-bg:transparent;--inter-disable-borderColor:transparent" rel="noreferrer noopener" target="_blank" href="https://www.coinbase.com/en-de/learn/your-crypto/what-is-wrapped-crypto"><span class=" inline-i1d5xt2g currentColor-c1ul679q inherit-i8cekjn inherit-i5yfwju inherit-i19jd86n inherit-i1q2zm4n start-szg9oeq none-ng7kred baseCss-bc3l1w2" style="--text-textTransform:var(--textTransform-inherit)">mirror the value</span></a> of another cryptocurrency from a different blockchain and address the challenge of interoperability between blockchains. A wrapped token has exactly the same value as the original cryptocurrency, but is compatible with a different blockchain.</p><p class="Text__TextBodyLarge-sc-f188a967-4 Section__StyledTextBodyLarge-sc-7e3c6137-0 kSsJYJ eCzJqN">Bitcoin and Ethereum<!-- -->, for instance, operate on different protocols and can’t directly interact with each other. Wrapped tokens bridge this gap, allowing assets from one blockchain to be used on another. Wrapped versions of bitcoin<!-- --> can be used to trade on DeFi platforms or as collateral for loans, for example. </p><p class="Text__TextBodyLarge-sc-f188a967-4 Section__StyledTextBodyLarge-sc-7e3c6137-0 kSsJYJ eCzJqN">Wrapped Bitcoin<!-- --> (wBTC) is the most popular wrapped token, with a market cap of <a class=" inline-i1d5xt2g fgPrimary-f1viahif _0-_19in606 _0-_sikgx6 _0-_1dt7gbp cds-Interactable baseCss-b17wmk8f baseCss-b1nrmodp baseCss-b678mx9" style="--inter-bg:var(--color-transparent);--inter-borderColor:var(--color-transparent);--inter-hover-bg:transparent;--inter-hover-borderColor:transparent;--inter-hover-opacity:0.88;--inter-press-bg:transparent;--inter-press-borderColor:transparent;--inter-press-opacity:0.82;--inter-disable-bg:transparent;--inter-disable-borderColor:transparent" rel="noreferrer noopener" target="_blank" href="https://www.coingecko.com/en/coins/wrapped-bitcoin"><span class=" inline-i1d5xt2g currentColor-c1ul679q inherit-i8cekjn inherit-i5yfwju inherit-i19jd86n inherit-i1q2zm4n start-szg9oeq none-ng7kred baseCss-bc3l1w2" style="--text-textTransform:var(--textTransform-inherit)">nearly $10 billion</span></a>, and has become a popular option for bitcoin<!-- --> users to move some of their liquidity to Ethereum<!-- --> without needing to sell their bitcoin<!-- --> holdings. </p><p class="Text__TextBodyLarge-sc-f188a967-4 Section__StyledTextBodyLarge-sc-7e3c6137-0 kSsJYJ eCzJqN"><strong class="RichText__BoldText-sc-a0f6aa2-0 ireNeW">What is cbBTC?</strong></p><p class="Text__TextBodyLarge-sc-f188a967-4 Section__StyledTextBodyLarge-sc-7e3c6137-0 kSsJYJ eCzJqN">cbBTC is a wrapped version of bitcoin<!-- --> that can currently be used on the Base and Ethereum<!-- --> blockchains (with support for <a class=" inline-i1d5xt2g fgPrimary-f1viahif _0-_19in606 _0-_sikgx6 _0-_1dt7gbp cds-Interactable baseCss-b17wmk8f baseCss-b1nrmodp baseCss-b678mx9" style="--inter-bg:var(--color-transparent);--inter-borderColor:var(--color-transparent);--inter-hover-bg:transparent;--inter-hover-borderColor:transparent;--inter-hover-opacity:0.88;--inter-press-bg:transparent;--inter-press-borderColor:transparent;--inter-press-opacity:0.82;--inter-disable-bg:transparent;--inter-disable-borderColor:transparent" rel="noreferrer noopener" target="_blank" href="https://x.com/CoinbaseAssets/status/1837511990660551061"><span class=" inline-i1d5xt2g currentColor-c1ul679q inherit-i8cekjn inherit-i5yfwju inherit-i19jd86n inherit-i1q2zm4n start-szg9oeq none-ng7kred baseCss-bc3l1w2" style="--text-textTransform:var(--textTransform-inherit)">Solana coming soon</span></a>.) Like other wrapped tokens, it exists to help create interoperability between blockchains.</p><p class="Text__TextBodyLarge-sc-f188a967-4 Section__StyledTextBodyLarge-sc-7e3c6137-0 kSsJYJ eCzJqN">cbBTC users can opt to lock some of their bitcoin<!-- --> with Coinbase, which acts as a custodian for the tokens, and receive cbBTC on the compatible blockchain of their choice. (Coinbase has also announced plans to provide proof of reserves for cbBTC in the <a class=" inline-i1d5xt2g fgPrimary-f1viahif _0-_19in606 _0-_sikgx6 _0-_1dt7gbp cds-Interactable baseCss-b17wmk8f baseCss-b1nrmodp baseCss-b678mx9" style="--inter-bg:var(--color-transparent);--inter-borderColor:var(--color-transparent);--inter-hover-bg:transparent;--inter-hover-borderColor:transparent;--inter-hover-opacity:0.88;--inter-press-bg:transparent;--inter-press-borderColor:transparent;--inter-press-opacity:0.82;--inter-disable-bg:transparent;--inter-disable-borderColor:transparent" rel="noreferrer noopener" target="_blank" href="https://www.coinbase.com/price/near-protocol"><span class=" inline-i1d5xt2g currentColor-c1ul679q inherit-i8cekjn inherit-i5yfwju inherit-i19jd86n inherit-i1q2zm4n start-szg9oeq none-ng7kred baseCss-bc3l1w2" style="--text-textTransform:var(--textTransform-inherit)">near</span></a> future.) </p><p class="Text__TextBodyLarge-sc-f188a967-4 Section__StyledTextBodyLarge-sc-7e3c6137-0 kSsJYJ eCzJqN">For Coinbase users the minting process is <a class=" inline-i1d5xt2g fgPrimary-f1viahif _0-_19in606 _0-_sikgx6 _0-_1dt7gbp cds-Interactable baseCss-b17wmk8f baseCss-b1nrmodp baseCss-b678mx9" style="--inter-bg:var(--color-transparent);--inter-borderColor:var(--color-transparent);--inter-hover-bg:transparent;--inter-hover-borderColor:transparent;--inter-hover-opacity:0.88;--inter-press-bg:transparent;--inter-press-borderColor:transparent;--inter-press-opacity:0.82;--inter-disable-bg:transparent;--inter-disable-borderColor:transparent" rel="noreferrer noopener" target="_blank" href="https://www.coinbase.com/en-de/blog/coinbase-wrapped-btc-cbbtc-is-now-live"><span class=" inline-i1d5xt2g currentColor-c1ul679q inherit-i8cekjn inherit-i5yfwju inherit-i19jd86n inherit-i1q2zm4n start-szg9oeq none-ng7kred baseCss-bc3l1w2" style="--text-textTransform:var(--textTransform-inherit)">simple</span></a>. All you need to do is send the bitcoin<!-- --> you have in your Coinbase account to an external address on either Base or Ethereum<!-- -->, and it will automatically be converted 1:1 into cbBTC. </p><p class="Text__TextBodyLarge-sc-f188a967-4 Section__StyledTextBodyLarge-sc-7e3c6137-0 kSsJYJ eCzJqN">Since launch earlier this month, users have <a class=" inline-i1d5xt2g fgPrimary-f1viahif _0-_19in606 _0-_sikgx6 _0-_1dt7gbp cds-Interactable baseCss-b17wmk8f baseCss-b1nrmodp baseCss-b678mx9" style="--inter-bg:var(--color-transparent);--inter-borderColor:var(--color-transparent);--inter-hover-bg:transparent;--inter-hover-borderColor:transparent;--inter-hover-opacity:0.88;--inter-press-bg:transparent;--inter-press-borderColor:transparent;--inter-press-opacity:0.82;--inter-disable-bg:transparent;--inter-disable-borderColor:transparent" rel="noreferrer noopener" target="_blank" href="https://dune.com/cbinstitutional_team/cbbtc"><span class=" inline-i1d5xt2g currentColor-c1ul679q inherit-i8cekjn inherit-i5yfwju inherit-i19jd86n inherit-i1q2zm4n start-szg9oeq none-ng7kred baseCss-bc3l1w2" style="--text-textTransform:var(--textTransform-inherit)">already minted</span></a> nearly $200 million worth of cbBTC, with around $100 million minted on the first day alone, according to Dune Analytics. </p><p class="Text__TextBodyLarge-sc-f188a967-4 Section__StyledTextBodyLarge-sc-7e3c6137-0 kSsJYJ eCzJqN"><strong class="RichText__BoldText-sc-a0f6aa2-0 ireNeW">The bottom line… </strong></p><p class="Text__TextBodyLarge-sc-f188a967-4 Section__StyledTextBodyLarge-sc-7e3c6137-0 kSsJYJ eCzJqN">The launch of cbBTC and its rapid adoption highlights crypto users’ need for trusted and convenient ways to utilize their bitcoin<!-- --> liquidity on other blockchains. </p><p class="Text__TextBodyLarge-sc-f188a967-4 Section__StyledTextBodyLarge-sc-7e3c6137-0 kSsJYJ eCzJqN">“By bringing assets across more chains, wrapped assets like cbBTC help build a more efficient, interconnected and expansive financial ecosystem,” Coinbase said in a blog post. </p><div class="ButtonCTA__ButtonContainer-sc-96b17354-0 iqekWz"><a class=" flex-ff5rfy6 fg-f1sorag4 _0-_19in606 _900-_1i1nlmz _0-_sikgx6 _4-_sm7rau _2-_1ubvwd9 _0-_1dt7gbp height-hlltmgk minWidth-mqpqo7l cds-Interactable baseCss-b17wmk8f baseCss-b1nrmodp scaledDownCss-s1o6alxd cds-Button baseCss-b99zquh" style="--height:fit-content;--minWidth:auto;--inter-bg:var(--color-bgSecondary);--inter-borderColor:var(--color-bgSecondary);--inter-hover-bg:rgb(229, 231, 234);--inter-hover-borderColor:rgb(229, 231, 234);--inter-hover-opacity:0.88;--inter-press-bg:rgb(225, 226, 229);--inter-press-borderColor:rgb(225, 226, 229);--inter-press-opacity:0.82;--inter-disable-bg:rgb(242, 244, 246);--inter-disable-borderColor:rgb(242, 244, 246)" data-block="false" data-variant="secondary" href="https://www.coinbase.com/blog/coinbase-wrapped-btc-cbbtc-is-now-live"><span class="middleNodeCss-m1avpq52"><span class=" inline-i1d5xt2g currentColor-c1ul679q headline-h15u0we0 headline-h1cz184y headline-h1axe68h headline-h1d8xh3w center-cfz97j9 none-ng7kred baseCss-bc3l1w2" style="--text-textTransform:var(--textTransform-headline)"><span class="">Learn more about cbBTC</span></span></span></a></div><span class=" flex-ff5rfy6 height-hlltmgk flexShrink-f174hu22 flexGrow-fav9hyl" style="--height:calc(8 * var(--space-1));--flexShrink:0;--flexGrow:0" aria-hidden="true" role="presentation"></span><h2 class=" block-bvmbflj fg-f1sorag4 headline-h15u0we0 headline-h1cz184y headline-h1axe68h headline-h1d8xh3w start-szg9oeq none-ng7kred baseCss-bc3l1w2" style="--text-textTransform:var(--textTransform-headline)"><strong class="RichText__BoldText-sc-a0f6aa2-0 ireNeW">NUMBERS TO KNOW</strong></h2><h3 class=" block-bvmbflj fg-f1sorag4 display2-d3fywui display2-d1fkc23d display2-dmahq7d display2-d10bcbec start-szg9oeq none-ng7kred _3-_1vs0x97 baseCss-bc3l1w2" style="--text-textTransform:var(--textTransform-display2)"><strong class="RichText__BoldText-sc-a0f6aa2-0 ireNeW"><strong class="RichText__BoldText-sc-a0f6aa2-0 ireNeW">$1.25 billion</strong></strong></h3><p class="Text__TextBodyLarge-sc-f188a967-4 Section__StyledTextBodyLarge-sc-7e3c6137-0 kSsJYJ eCzJqN"><a class=" inline-i1d5xt2g fgPrimary-f1viahif _0-_19in606 _0-_sikgx6 _0-_1dt7gbp cds-Interactable baseCss-b17wmk8f baseCss-b1nrmodp baseCss-b678mx9" style="--inter-bg:var(--color-transparent);--inter-borderColor:var(--color-transparent);--inter-hover-bg:transparent;--inter-hover-borderColor:transparent;--inter-hover-opacity:0.88;--inter-press-bg:transparent;--inter-press-borderColor:transparent;--inter-press-opacity:0.82;--inter-disable-bg:transparent;--inter-disable-borderColor:transparent" rel="noreferrer noopener" target="_blank" href="https://www.theblock.co/post/317558/plume-network-says-its-tokenizing-over-1-billion-in-real-world-assets-like-solar-farms-medicaid-claims-and-mineral-rights"><span class=" inline-i1d5xt2g currentColor-c1ul679q inherit-i8cekjn inherit-i5yfwju inherit-i19jd86n inherit-i1q2zm4n start-szg9oeq none-ng7kred baseCss-bc3l1w2" style="--text-textTransform:var(--textTransform-inherit)">Estimated value</span></a> of assets — including solar farms, private credit, Med